{"4991820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fingerdrums", "steam_appid": 4991820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world is full of rhythms and beats waiting to be discovered.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fingerdrums is a short experience where your fingers become the sticks of the drums. Use the touchpads of the Steam Deck or Steam Controller to drum your way through the hand-drawn scenes inspired by rhythms and beats from around the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991820/extras/062968571795f08741d611a1234c983e.poster.avif?t=1785819671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991820/extras/062968571795f08741d611a1234c983e.webm?t=1785819671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991820/extras/062968571795f08741d611a1234c983e.mp4?t=1785819671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole experience will take roughly 30 minutes, where you will explore a series of abstract scenes which you can finish like you are used to with nostalgic rhythm games like Guitar Hero or Tap Tap Revenge. Make sure to hit the pads on the right time. On the beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While Fingerdrums is designed around the unique touchpads of the Steam Deck and Steam Controller, it can also be played with a regular controller or keyboard using customizable controls.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991820/extras/f0b9cb2651704d3f500